## What was wrong

The plan-aware model gating feature (upstream ollama commit `bab59072`, "launch: add plan-aware model gating (#16027)") had been stripped from the source: 9 existing source files were reverted to their pre-feature state and 1 new file deleted, while the tests were left in place. The tests referenced symbols that no longer existed:

- `api.ModelRecommendation.RequiredPlan` (api, server)
- `launch.AccountState`, `ApplyAccountStateToSelectionItems`, `SelectionItemsWithAccountState`, `ModelItem.RequiredPlan`/`AvailabilityBadge` (cmd/launch)
- `launch.DefaultUpgrade`, `DefaultSingleSelectorWithUpdates`, `DefaultMultiSelectorWithUpdates`, `DefaultUpgradeURL` (cmd/launch, cmd/tui)
- `SelectItem.AvailabilityBadge`, `selectorItemsUpdatedMsg`, `renderUpgrade` (cmd/tui)
- `RunModelRequest`/`IntegrationLaunchRequest` account-state fields and `launcherDeps.accountState/accountStateUpdates` (cmd, cmd/launch)

## The fix

I verified via tree-blob comparison that this repo is exactly upstream `bab59072` with that commit's changes removed (every one of the 10 differing files matched the parent commit `bab59072^` byte-for-byte, and every other file matched `bab59072`). I restored the 10 source files from the upstream commit:

- **api/types.go** — `RequiredPlan` field on `ModelRecommendation` (`required_plan` JSON)
- **cmd/launch/account.go** (new) — `AccountState`, plan/status constants, `ApplyAccountStateToSelectionItems`, `SelectionItemsWithAccountState` (badge logic: "Sign in required" when signed out, "Upgrade required" when the model's required plan exceeds the user's plan, no badge when satisfied or state unknown)
- **cmd/launch/launch.go, models.go, selector_hooks.go** — `RequiredPlan`/`AvailabilityBadge` on `ModelItem`, `SelectionItem` alias, `DefaultUpgrade` / `*WithUpdates` hooks, upgrade-gating in `ResolveRunModel` (sign-in vs. upgrade paths, re-selection on upgrade cancellation)
- **cmd/cmd.go** — plumbs prefetched account state and update channels into the TUI menu and run/integration requests
- **cmd/tui/selector.go, signin.go** — availability badge rendering on the cursor row, live item updates (`selectorItemsUpdatedMsg`), `renderUpgrade` flow
- **server/model_recommendations.go, routes.go** — persists/serves `required_plan` in model recommendations

